1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,583
For a few dawns each winter,

2
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:04,736
sunlight creeps into a tomb

3
00:00:04,736 --> 00:00:07,399
over five thousand years old.

4
00:00:08,199 --> 00:00:10,510
Why build the sky into stone?

5
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:11,945
For early farmers,

6
00:00:11,945 --> 00:00:14,287
the sun was the calendar.

7
00:00:14,437 --> 00:00:16,086
Solstices and equinoxes

8
00:00:16,086 --> 00:00:17,806
told them when to plant,

9
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:20,163
harvest and honour the dead.

10
00:00:20,313 --> 00:00:22,146
And temples that matched

11
00:00:22,146 --> 00:00:24,131
the heavens tied rulers to

12
00:00:24,131 --> 00:00:26,466
the order of the universe.

13
00:00:27,266 --> 00:00:29,537
At Newgrange in Ireland, a slot

14
00:00:29,537 --> 00:00:31,954
above the door lets the midwinter

15
00:00:31,954 --> 00:00:34,208
sunrise light the chamber.

16
00:00:35,008 --> 00:00:37,580
Egypt's Great Pyramid faces north,

17
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,849
south, east and west to within

18
00:00:39,849 --> 00:00:42,014
a fifteenth of a degree.

19
00:00:42,814 --> 00:00:45,064
El Castillo, at Chichén Itzá

20
00:00:45,064 --> 00:00:47,394
in Mexico, has four stairways

21
00:00:47,394 --> 00:00:49,351
of ninety-one steps.

22
00:00:49,501 --> 00:00:51,276
Add the top platform:

23
00:00:51,276 --> 00:00:53,727
three hundred and sixty-five,

24
00:00:53,727 --> 00:00:56,528
one for each day of the year.

25
00:00:57,328 --> 00:00:59,507
Angkor Wat in Cambodia maps

26
00:00:59,507 --> 00:01:01,686
the cosmos: five towers for

27
00:01:01,686 --> 00:01:03,623
the peaks of Mount Meru,

28
00:01:03,623 --> 00:01:06,233
a moat for the cosmic ocean.

29
00:01:08,183 --> 00:01:10,213
So how did they do it,

30
00:01:10,213 --> 00:01:12,223
without a compass?

31
00:01:12,373 --> 00:01:14,659
By watching. On the equinox,

32
00:01:14,659 --> 00:01:17,434
the tip of a stick's shadow traces

33
00:01:17,434 --> 00:01:20,233
a near-perfect east–west line.

34
00:01:21,033 --> 00:01:22,688
The real mystery isn't

35
00:01:22,688 --> 00:01:24,568
who helped them. It's how

36
00:01:24,568 --> 00:01:27,249
patiently they watched the sky.
